LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Jon DelCollo is a Philly-based stand-up comedian and podcaster 
 from Wilmington\, Delaware. On top of performing at comedy clubs across the
  country\, he was a featured performer at the Adult Swim Festival Block Par
 ty in 2022.\n\nJon co-hosts a comedy true crime podcast called Lil Stinkers
 \, and has appeared in a couple Bud Light commercials with Shane Gillis. In
  his spare time\, Jon enjoys camping and hiking\, watching Impractical Joke
 rs until his legs are numb\, and spending time with his lovely family.\n\nM
 anagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facilit
 y who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https
